      "title_zh": "Mastercard联合BVNK推出Global Money Platform以支持稳定币支付",
      "title_orig": "Today, we're launching Mastercard Global Money Platform with @BVNKFinance, enabling banks, fintechs, and enterprises to offer stablecoin payments, loc...",
